## ✅ 第四階段：驗證和監控

### 7. 驗證定時任務狀態

#### Windows

```powershell
# 查看任務狀態
Get-ScheduledTask -TaskName "WuchangAutoComplianceCheck"

# 查看任務執行信息
Get-ScheduledTask -TaskName "WuchangAutoComplianceCheck" | Get-ScheduledTaskInfo

# 查看執行歷史
Get-WinEvent -LogName Microsoft-Windows-TaskScheduler/Operational | Where-Object {$_.Message -like '*WuchangAutoComplianceCheck*'}
```

#### macOS

```bash
# 查看任務狀態
launchctl list | grep wuchang

# 查看任務詳情
launchctl list com.wuchang.autocompliancecheck

# 查看日誌
tail -f logs/compliance_check_stdout.log
tail -f logs/compliance_check_stderr.log
```

#### Linux

```bash
# 查看定時器狀態
sudo systemctl status wuchang-autocompliancecheck.timer

# 查看服務狀態
sudo systemctl status wuchang-autocompliancecheck.service

# 查看日誌
sudo journalctl -u wuchang-autocompliancecheck.service -f
```

**狀態**：☐ 未完成

